+## Why
+
+The booking desk has no way to rent out boards and sails. The school needs a rental module, starting with the basics: register equipment, quote a rental, and book it without double-booking.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `createRentalService()`, exported from `src/index.ts`, returning an in-memory rental service.
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` registers a board or sail.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns the price of a rental period.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` books an item and returns the booking.
+- Rules enforced: integer euro cents, UTC ISO-8601 times, whole-day periods, no overlapping bookings per item.
+- Out of scope: cancellations. The cancellation policy (no refund under 24 h before start, otherwise full refund) is recorded for later but not implemented.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: registering equipment, quoting and booking whole-day rental periods.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New code under `src/` (no runtime dependencies), new tests run with `node --test`.
